    "Weak regret: per-round loss is min of the two selected arms' losses",
    "Linear link function phi(x_i,x_j)=(1+x_i-x_j)/2 known to the learner; binary outcome is Bernoulli with this bias; utilities x_t in [0,1]^K chosen adversarially per round, loss = 1 - utility",
