   ],
   "definition_quote": "The environment fixes a sequence of skew-symmetric outcome matrices ... In addition to the sequence of outcome matrices, the environment fixes a sequence of loss vectors ... \\bm \\ell_t \\in [0, 1]^K ... we will bound the utilities by the zero-one interval and use the linear link function \\phi(x_i, x_j) = \\frac{1 + x_i - x_j} 2. ... R_W(T) = \\sum_{t=1}^T \\min \\{ \\ell_t^{A_t}, \\ell_t^{B_t} \\} - \\min_a \\sum_{t=1}^T \\ell_t^a."
